  << /ActualText (Icons are sized proportionally with the height being a multiple of 8\056 The heights being used are 16px\054 24px and 32px\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 497 0 R
     /Pg 490 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
