504 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The width and height properties are not the only ones that use the 8px system\056 Margins and paddings also do that\054 especially the top and bottom values\056 This is necessary to ensure a proper vertical rhytm that allows elements to fall on the same baseline\056)
     /K [ 7 ]
     /P 505 0 R
     /Pg 490 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

